OL,3,GNEWSATeddies and flowers left at scene
OL,4,Awhere six-year-old boy died in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-year-old boy has died following a
OL,7,Fcar crash and a man has been arrested,
OL,8,Fpolice have said.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to reports of an
OL,11,Fincident involving a vehicle and a
OL,12,Fchild in Llanfairfechan, Conwy county,
OL,13,Fafter 17:00 BST on Thursday, where the
OL,14,Fchild was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,16,FNorth Wales Police said a 39-year-old
OL,17,Fman had been arrested, while the boy's
OL,18,Ffamily was being supported by specially
OL,19,Ftrained family liaison officers.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
